WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
(audience applauding)

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.666
- Gosh, hi!

00:00:01.666 --> 00:00:02.541
- [Kelly] I love your outfit!

00:00:02.541 --> 00:00:04.180
- Thank you, likewise!
- [Kelly] So cute!

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:05.013
- Oh my gosh!

00:00:05.013 --> 00:00:05.846
- [Kelly] So cute!

00:00:05.846 --> 00:00:06.679
How are you doing?

00:00:06.679 --> 00:00:07.512
- I'm really good, thank you for-

00:00:07.512 --> 00:00:08.380
- Have y'all, have you ever met?

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.810
- I don't wanna do the
thing of where you go like,

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:12.680
oh, like, we've met before.

00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:14.527
I don't expect you to remember
me, but we have met before.

00:00:14.527 --> 00:00:15.360
(Kelly laughing)

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.193
- Where did we meet?

00:00:16.193 --> 00:00:17.120
- I never do that to people

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:19.867
where they're like, we've actually met.

00:00:19.867 --> 00:00:20.700
- Like, I always like, assume
people don't remember me.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:21.533
- Me too!

00:00:21.533 --> 00:00:22.366
- I had a radio show,

00:00:22.366 --> 00:00:23.199
and you came into it one time,

00:00:23.199 --> 00:00:24.660
and you gave me advice,
and you were awesome.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.320
And I told you my favorite
piece of Dr. Phil advice,

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:28.530
that I learned early on

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:30.660
and my mom, like, really drilled into me

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:32.447
and it always replays in my head is,

00:00:32.447 --> 00:00:33.870
"How's that working for yah?"

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:34.703
- How's that working for yah?

00:00:34.703 --> 00:00:35.820
- And, "How's that working for yah?"

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:37.520
It's such a great thing to ask yourself!

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:38.500
- It is, isn't it?

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.333
- Yeah.

00:00:39.333 --> 00:00:40.166
- [Kelly] It is!

00:00:40.166 --> 00:00:40.999
- Yeah, will you ask it for me right now?

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:41.832
- Yeah, how's that working for yah?

00:00:41.832 --> 00:00:43.155
- Oh God, that felt good!
(Kelly laughing and clapping)

00:00:43.155 --> 00:00:44.506
(audience laughing)

00:00:44.506 --> 00:00:45.714
- So wait, do you need--
(audience applauding)

00:00:45.714 --> 00:00:46.547
- I just screen shotted that memory.

00:00:46.547 --> 00:00:48.540
- Do you need any advice
right now, on anything?

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:50.640
- Actually, yes, something just came up!

00:00:50.640 --> 00:00:51.473
- [Kelly] Okay.

00:00:51.473 --> 00:00:52.470
- So Dr. Phil,

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:54.560
I struggle with like, regret,

00:00:54.560 --> 00:00:57.080
of like, there will be
things I say, stupid things.

00:00:57.080 --> 00:00:58.080
I'm like, why did I do that?

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:59.890
- And I'll ruminate on it!

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:02.620
Like, for instance, like,
I just told Dr. Phil

00:01:02.620 --> 00:01:03.930
I loved him when I hugged him,

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:05.659
and I don't know why I said that!

00:01:05.659 --> 00:01:06.492
(Kelly laughing boisterously)
(audience laughing)

00:01:06.492 --> 00:01:07.620
And I wanna know what should I do later on

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:08.760
when I can't sleep 'cause I'm like,

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:10.700
why would I say I love him to him?

00:01:10.700 --> 00:01:12.910
Like, I do, but like,
he didn't say it back

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:13.743
and that's weird.
(audience laughing)

00:01:13.743 --> 00:01:15.507
- [Kelly] You love what
he does for people!

00:01:15.507 --> 00:01:16.340
(Kelly laughing hysterically)

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:19.723
- Like, I just know I'm
gonna be haunted by it later!

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:23.009
What do I do later on?

00:01:23.009 --> 00:01:23.842
- You didn't say it back?

00:01:23.842 --> 00:01:26.590
- Well, two things, if I had heard it,

00:01:26.590 --> 00:01:30.140
I would've been flattered,
but I didn't hear it,

00:01:30.140 --> 00:01:31.390
but I'm glad that you said it.

00:01:31.390 --> 00:01:33.763
- I think I whispered it,
which is even creepier.

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:37.247
- I tried to have an
intimate moment with you.

00:01:37.247 --> 00:01:38.365
What I'm I doing?

00:01:38.365 --> 00:01:39.865
- I, love this show.

